integration, copyright its respective contributors, under Apache License 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/2026.9.4/homeassistant/components/monoprice
Original manifest codeowners: @etsinko and @OnFreund.

The starting point was the user's locally extended integration, including
bass/treble/balance entities and cached zone state. EndOfTheLine-HA modified
setup and lifecycle handling to add the HDMI matrix device choice. Amplifier
entity identifiers and snapshot/restore service names are retained.
Matrix support is implemented from the user's existing HTTP routing scripts.
